type: software
title: "agent-governance-loop"
abstract: >-
  A deployable governance pattern for AI agents on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore:
  Cedar policy at the Gateway, Bedrock Guardrails in policy, OpenTelemetry
  tracing to CloudWatch, and an evidence loop that turns a trace into a
  regression test.
